window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A Full-Throttle Urban Fantasy Series with Werewolves, Shifters, Magic, and Dragons</b></p> <p>Over 90 Hours of Action-Packed Urban Fantasy! Dive into two full-length urban fantasy sagas in one epic audiobook edition. This monster-sized collection features The Supernatural Bounty Hunter Files (Series 1) and The Supernatural Dragon Hunter Files (Series 2)—an 18-book odyssey of monsters, magic, and mayhem.</p> <p>Follow John Smoke—a cunning ex-con turned supernatural bounty hunter—and his partner, Sidney Shaw, a fearless former FBI sharpshooter—as they battle shapeshifters, werewolves, shadowy conspiracies, and inter-dimensional dragons. From secret D.C. wars to world-bending portal invasions, the stakes climb fast and never let up.</p> <p>These two badass heroes charge headfirst into chaos, fueled by grit, firepower, and zero tolerance for evil. Across two full series and ninety nonstop hours, they’ll uncover hidden truths, forge unlikely alliances, and take on a war that spans dimensions.</p> <p>Whether you’re commuting, working out, or binging late into the night, this is the ultimate supernatural experience.</p> <p>Perfect for fans of: The Dresden Files, Supernatural, Monster Hunter International, and The Iron Druid Chronicles.</p> <p>Narrated for maximum immersion. Two series. Two unstoppable heroes. Ninety hours of jaw-dropping fantasy.</p>"; 
